    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks but it feels different than just \"sadness.\" it feels like a calculation. everything i did for two decades was an investment of my time and energy, and now the account is at zero. i've spent my whole life building something and now it's just gone, and i don't have the energy to start over. there's no \"next chapter\" if the foundation is totally hollowed out. it just feels like the math doesn't add up anymore. why keep paying into a system that's already bankrupt?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
